  "title": "Easy Beef Shawarma",
  "description": "Sliced steak, tomatoes, onions, and tahini sauce are wrapped in tortillas and grilled in a panini press to make these easy shawarma wraps.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah Qennah"
  ],
